vice permanently retired."},"1073":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/device-management-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/device-management#device-states","content":"The inventory lets you filter by `Device ID`, tags and status."},"1074":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/device-management-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/device-management#inspect-a-device","content":"The detail view separates two perspectives:"},"1075":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/device-management-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/device-management#inspect-a-device","content":"**Certificate History** keeps every certificate associated with the device, with its serial number, issuer, status and validity period."},"1076":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/device-management-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/device-management#inspect-a-device","content":"**Device Event Timeline** orders registrations, enrollments, renewals and status changes chronologically."},"1077":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/device-management-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/device-management#inspect-a-device","content":"Use the history for audit and the timeline to reconstruct an incident or diagnose an unexpected transition."},"1078":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/device-management-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/device-management#register-a-device-manuall