iew/pr-28/platform/pki/device-management-37","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/device-management#revoke-the-current-identity","content":"Revocation invalidates the certificate but does not delete the device. You can restore its operation by assigning it a new identity. `CertificateHold` allows reactivating the retained certificate; all other reasons are final."},"1091":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/device-management-38","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/device-management#decommission-a-device","content":"This action revokes all the device's certificates and prevents it from obtaining an identity again."},"1092":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/device-management-39","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/device-management#decommission-a-device","content":"Use **Decommission** only when the device has stopped operating or is no longer trustworthy. After confirming, Lamassu revokes the active identity with `CessationOfOperation` and changes the status to **Decommissioned**."},"1093":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/device-management-40","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/device-management#automate-enrollment","content":"<Card title=\"Configure a DMS\" description=\"Define the CA, trust and policies of the fleet.\" href=\"/docs/platform/pki/device-enrollment\" />"},"1094":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/device-management-41","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/device-management#automate-enrollment","content":"<Card title=\"Integrate EST\" descriptio