url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/est-enrollment#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"The client certificate is not valid against `ValidationCAs`."},"1297":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/est-enrollment-201","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/est-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/est-enrollment#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"Check the bootstrap certificate chain."},"1298":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/est-enrollment-202","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/est-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/est-enrollment#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"500"},"1299":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/est-enrollment-203","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/est-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/est-enrollment#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"`certificate is revoked`"},"1300":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/est-enrollment-204","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/est-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/est-enrollment#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"The certificate **presented as the mTLS credential** is revoked in Lamassu or via external OCSP/CRL."},"1301":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/est-enrollment-205","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/est-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/est-enrollment#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"Request a new bootstrap certificate or investigate the revocation."},"1302":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/est-enrollment-206","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/est-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/est-enrollment#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"500"},"1303":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/est-enro