nd the CSR in the browser, and the CA will issue the certificate. When you finish you will download the certificate and its private key."},"1748":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#before-you-begin","content":"An active CA with permission to issue certificates."},"1749":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#before-you-begin","content":"A name for the identity, for example `device-001.example.internal`."},"1750":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#before-you-begin","content":"A safe place to keep the downloaded private key."},"1751":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#before-you-begin","content":"In this flow the key is generated in the browser and Lamassu does not store it. Download it and protect it before closing the operation result."},"1752":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#start-the-issuance","content":"Open the CA created in the previous quickstart, go to **Issued Certificates** and select **Issue N