erstand the model, but a fleet should use automated enrollment. Continue with Device Management Service and the EST integration."},"1791":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/troubleshooting","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"page","content":"Troubleshooting","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Platform","Administer Lamassu"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/troubleshooting"},"1792":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/troubleshooting-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/troubleshooting","content":"Diagnose access, health, issuance, enrollment and dependencies in a Lamassu deployment."},"1793":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/troubleshooting-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/troubleshooting#diagnostic-sequence","content":"Diagnostic sequence"},"1794":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/troubleshooting-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/troubleshooting#reproduce-a-single-operation","content":"Reproduce a single operation"},"1795":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/troubleshooting-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/troubleshooting#separate-client-gateway-and-service","content":"Separate client, Gateway and service"},"1796":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/troubleshooting-4","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/troubleshooting#review-kubernetes-status","content":"Review Kubernetes status"},"1797":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/troubleshooting-5","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr