platform/pki/troubleshooting#separate-client-gateway-and-service","content":"Check the HTTP status. A 401 points to authentication; a 403, to authorization; a 404, to route or resource; a 5xx, to the service or a dependency."},"1811":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/troubleshooting-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/troubleshooting#review-kubernetes-status","content":"Locate unready pods, restarts, recent events and the state of the release."},"1812":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/troubleshooting-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/troubleshooting#query-the-affected-service","content":"Review its /health endpoint and its logs in the same time window. Then follow the indicated dependency: PostgreSQL, RabbitMQ, the OIDC provider or the cryptographic engine."},"1813":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/troubleshooting-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/troubleshooting#validate-the-result-from-outside","content":"For PKI, check the certificate, the chain, OCSP or CRL with the same type of client production uses."},"1814":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/troubleshooting-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/troubleshooting#minimal-evidence-collection","content":"Replace the placeholders with your real release, namespace and deployment."},"1815":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/troubleshooting-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/platform/pki/troubleshooting#minimal-evidence-collection","content":"Also run the chart's connectivity test:"},"1816":{"id":