ficados y perfiles de emisión;"},"593":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/audit-logs-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/audit-logs#cobertura","content":"claves y motores KMS;"},"594":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/audit-logs-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/audit-logs#cobertura","content":"dispositivos e identidades;"},"595":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/audit-logs-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/audit-logs#cobertura","content":"DMS y operaciones de enrolamiento;"},"596":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/audit-logs-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/audit-logs#cobertura","content":"funciones de validación y CRL;"},"597":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/audit-logs-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/audit-logs#cobertura","content":"principales, políticas y concesiones de autorización."},"598":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/audit-logs-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/audit-logs#cobertura","content":"No confundas estos eventos con los eventos de dominio. Un evento de dominio comunica que un recurso cambió para que otro componente reaccione; el evento de auditoría conserva contexto de entrada, salida y principal para investigación."},"599":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/audit-logs-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url"