"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/device-management#inspecciona-un-dispositivo","content":"Utiliza el historial para auditoría y la línea de tiempo para reconstruir un incidente o diagnosticar una transición inesperada."},"1078":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/device-management-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/device-management#registra-un-dispositivo-manualmente","content":"El registro previo es útil cuando la política exige que el dispositivo exista antes de solicitar su primer certificado."},"1079":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/device-management-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/device-management#crea-el-dispositivo","content":"Desde **Managed Devices**, abre el formulario de registro."},"1080":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/device-management-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/device-management#define-su-pertenencia","content":"Introduce un **Device ID** único y selecciona el DMS que aplicará las políticas de enrolamiento y renovación."},"1081":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/device-management-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/device-management#clasifica-el-dispositivo","content":"Añade un icono y etiquetas si necesitas agruparlo por modelo, ubicación, entorno u otro criterio operativo."},"1082":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/device-management-29","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/device-management#verifica-el-alta","content":"El dispositivo debe a