"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/device-management#asigna-una-identidad-manualmente","content":"El dispositivo debe cambiar a **Active** y el certificado debe aparecer en su historial."},"1089":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/device-management-36","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/device-management#revoca-la-identidad-actual","content":"En **Device Event Timeline**, localiza el último certificado activo y selecciona **Revoke**. Elige una razón conforme a tu política y confirma la operación."},"1090":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/device-management-37","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/device-management#revoca-la-identidad-actual","content":"La revocación invalida el certificado, pero no elimina el dispositivo. Puedes restaurar su operación asignándole una identidad nueva. `CertificateHold` permite reactivar el certificado retenido; el resto de razones son definitivas."},"1091":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/device-management-38","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/device-management#retira-un-dispositivo","content":"Esta acción revoca todos los certificados del dispositivo e impide que vuelva a obtener una identidad."},"1092":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/device-management-39","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/device-management#retira-un-dispositivo","content":"Usa **Decommission** únicamente cuando el dispositivo haya dejado de operar o ya no sea fiable. Tras confirmar, Lamassu revoca la identidad activa con `CessationOfOperation` y cambia el estado a **Decommissioned**."},"1093":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/device-management-40","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/device-management#automatiza-el-enrolamiento","content":"<Card title=\"Configura un DMS\" description=\"Define la CA, confianza y políticas de la flota.\" href=\"/docs/platform/pki/device-enrollment\" />"},"1094":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/device-management-41","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/device-management#automatiza-el-enrolamiento","content":"<Card title=\"Integra EST\" description=\"Permite que el dispositivo solicite y renueve su identidad.\" href=\"/docs/platform/pki/est-enrollment\" />"},"1095":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/est-enrollment","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/est-enrollment","type":"page","content":"Enrolamiento de dispositivos con EST","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","Operar Lamassu"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/est-enrollment"},"1096":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/est-enrollment-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/est-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/est-enrollment","content":"Guía del protocolo EST en Lamassu IoT, con la configuración del DMS para el administrador PKI y la referencia de endpoints para el integrador de dispositivos."},"1097":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/est-enrollment-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/est-enrollment","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/est-enrollment#est-enrollment-over-secure-transport","content":"EST: Enrollment over Secure Transport"},"1098":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/est-enrollment-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/est-enrollment