pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#antes-de-empezar","content":"Acceso a la consola con permisos para gestionar autoridades."},"1720":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#antes-de-empezar","content":"Al menos un motor criptográfico disponible."},"1721":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#antes-de-empezar","content":"Un nombre que identifique el propósito de la CA, por ejemplo `Acme Device Root CA`."},"1722":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#antes-de-empezar","content":"Una CA raíz se autofirma y actúa como ancla de confianza. Para producción suele ser preferible mantener la raíz más protegida y emitir desde una CA intermedia."},"1723":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#abre-el-asistente-de-creación","content":"En el menú lateral, abre **Certification Authorities** y selecciona **Create New CA**."},"1724":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#abre-el-asistente-de-creación","content":"Elige crear una CA con un par de claves nuevo. Si ya tienes la clave en el KMS, usa &#x2A;*Create New CA (Existing Key)**."},"1725":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#selecciona-la-clave","content":"Elige el motor criptográfico que custodiará la clave y configura el algoritmo. Para una primera CA puedes usar **EC P-384**, siempre que sea compatible con tus consumidores."},"1726":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#selecciona-la-clave","content":"La clave privada permanecerá bajo el control del motor seleccionado."},"1727":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#define-la-autoridad","content":"Selecciona **Root CA** y completa:"},"1728":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#define-la-autoridad","content":"**CA Name**: un nombre único y reconocible."},"1729":{"id":"/do