e":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#verifica-el-resultado","content":"Verifica el resultado"},"1745":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#siguiente-paso","content":"Siguiente paso"},"1746":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","content":"En este quickstart Lamassu generará la clave y el CSR en el navegador, y la CA emitirá el certificado. Al terminar descargarás el certificado y su clave privada."},"1747":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#antes-de-empezar","content":"Una CA activa con permiso para emitir certificados."},"1748":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#antes-de-empezar","content":"Un nombre para la identidad, por ejemplo `device-001.example.internal`."},"1749":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#antes-de-empezar","content":"Un lugar seguro en el que custodiar la clave privada descargada."},