rl":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#configura-clave-y-usos","content":"Elige RSA o ECDSA, define la validez y selecciona los usos de clave. Para una identidad de dispositivo que usa mTLS, habilita **Digital Signature** y **Client Authentication**."},"1755":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#configura-clave-y-usos","content":"La validez no puede superar la fecha de expiración de la CA emisora."},"1756":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#emite-y-descarga","content":"Confirma la emisión y descarga inmediatamente el certificado y la clave privada en formato PEM."},"1757":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#verifica-el-resultado","content":"El certificado debe aparecer en **Issued Certificates** con estado activo. Comprueba su sujeto, SANs, emisor, usos y periodo de validez."},"1758":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#siguiente-paso","content":"Registra tu primer dispositivo para asociar la identidad a una entidad gestionada, o consulta la gestión de certificados."},"1759":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","page_id