ica-el-dispositivo","content":"Verifica el dispositivo"},"1776":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device-6","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device#automatiza-el-siguiente-dispositivo","content":"Automatiza el siguiente dispositivo"},"1777":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device-7","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","content":"En este quickstart registrarás manualmente un dispositivo y le asignarás su primer certificado. Es el recorrido más corto para entender cómo Lamassu relaciona una entidad física con su historial de identidades."},"1778":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device#antes-de-empezar","content":"Un DMS configurado."},"1779":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device#antes-de-empezar","content":"Una CA asociada al DMS."},"1780":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device#antes-de-empezar","content":"Un identificador único para el dispositivo."},"1781":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/quickst